  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "だいそうげんの　なかで　たたずみ\nひの　かたむきを　ながめて　くらす。\nダイナミックな　けりわざが　とくい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "넓은 초원 한복판에 우뚝 서서\n해가 기우는 것을 바라보며 지낸다.\n다이내믹한 발차기 기술이 특기다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "佇立在大草原上，\n每天眺望著日升日落。\n擅長強而有力的踢技。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se tient immobile au milieu des plaines\net passe son temps à observer la course du soleil\ndans le ciel. Son jeu de jambes est phénoménal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es verweilt auf weitläufigen Wiesen und\nbeobachtet den Lauf der Sonne. Dynamische\nTrittangriffe sind sein Spezialgebiet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pasa el tiempo observando inmóvil el recorrido\ndel sol sobre las extensas praderas que habita.\nSe especializa en técnicas de ágiles patadas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Trascorre le giornate nelle grandi praterie\nosservando immobile il passaggio del sole.\nLe mosse basate sui calci sono la sua specialità.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It stands in grasslands, watching the sun’s descent\nfrom zenith to horizon. This Pokémon has a talent\nfor delivering dynamic kicks.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大草原の　中で　たたずみ\n陽の　傾きを　眺めて　暮らす。\nダイナミックな　蹴り技が　得意。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "伫立在大草原里，\n每天眺望着日升日落。\n擅长强而有力的踢技。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pasa el tiempo observando inmóvil el recorrido\ndel sol sobre las extensas praderas que habita.\nSe especializa en técnicas de ágiles patadas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "１ねんに　いちど　きまった　にちじに\nどこから　ともなく　あつまり　わに\nなって　ならぶ　しゅうせいが　ある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "1년에 1번 정해진 일시에\n어디선가 모여 둥글게\n늘어서는 습성이 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "每年會有一天，牠們會在\n特定的時間突然出現，\n聚集在一起排成一個圈。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tous les ans à la même date, ils arrivent\nde nulle part pour se réunir en cercle.\nC’est une de leurs coutumes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sie haben die Angewohnheit, sich einmal im Jahr\nzu einer bestimmten Zeit wie aus dem Nichts zu\nversammeln und in einem Kreis aufzustellen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una vez al año y en una fecha concreta, tienen la\ncostumbre de aparecer de la nada para reunirse\ny formar un círculo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ogni anno, in un giorno stabilito, hanno l’usanza\ndi radunarsi giungendo da ogni dove per poi\ndisporsi in cerchio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Once a year, on a specific date and at a specific\ntime, they gather out of nowhere and form up in\na circle.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "１年に　一度　きまった　日時に\nどこから　ともなく　集まり　輪に\nなって　並ぶ　習性が　ある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "每年会有一天，它们会在\n特定的时间突然出现，\n聚集在一起排成一个圈。",
      "language": {
